system:
你是局部故事修订器。只返回获准目标的替换，禁止修改其他内容。保留所有已有line_id；新台词使用不重复的新ID。line范围仅返回指定一行，保留kind和speaker_role_id。scene/ending范围返回目标场景完整台词。episode_summary与事实关系伏笔增量须重新概括整集，不得保留已被修改内容产生的过时增量。closed_threads必须逐字引用来源线程。

你是一个结构化数据生成器。
只输出一个 JSON 对象，不要输出任何解释、前言、Markdown 代码围栏或注释。
JSON 必须严格符合以下 JSON Schema：
{
  "$defs": {
    "RevisionLine": {
      "properties": {
        "kind": {
          "title": "Kind",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "speaker_role_id": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Speaker Role Id"
        },
        "text": {
          "title": "Text",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "audio_cue_ref": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Audio Cue Ref"
        },
        "performance_hint": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Performance Hint"
        },
        "line_id": {
          "title": "Line Id",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "kind",
        "text",
        "line_id"
      ],
      "title": "RevisionLine",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "RevisionScene": {
      "properties": {
        "scene_id": {
          "title": "Scene Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "lines": {
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/RevisionLine"
          },
          "minItems": 1,
          "title": "Lines",
          "type": "array"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "scene_id",
        "lines"
      ],
      "title": "RevisionScene",
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  "properties": {
    "scenes": {
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/RevisionScene"
      },
      "minItems": 1,
      "title": "Scenes",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "episode_summary": {
      "title": "Episode Summary",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "fact_delta": {
      "items": {
        "additionalProperties": true,
        "type": "object"
      },
      "title": "Fact Delta",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "relationship_delta": {
      "items": {
        "additionalProperties": true,
        "type": "object"
      },
      "title": "Relationship Delta",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "new_open_threads": {
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "title": "New Open Threads",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "closed_threads": {
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "title": "Closed Threads",
      "type": "array"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "scenes",
    "episode_summary",
    "fact_delta",
    "relationship_delta",
    "new_open_threads",
    "closed_threads"
  ],
  "title": "EpisodeRevision",
  "type": "object"
}

若某字段在给定信息中无法确定，请依据 Schema 中的 description 做出最合理的专业推断，不要留空、不要填 null（除非 Schema 明确允许）。

response_text:
{
  "scenes": [
    {
      "scene_id": "ep2-scene3",
      "lines": [
        {
          "kind": "sfx",
          "speaker_role_id": null,
          "text": "万用表滴声",
          "line_id": "ep2-s3-l1"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_role_id": "repairer",
          "text": "数值正常。物理修复完成。",
          "line_id": "ep2-s3-l2"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_role_id": "host",
          "text": "太好了！我手都悬在铃铛上了，只要推闸有声音，我就敲三下给街坊们报平安！",
          "line_id": "ep2-s3-l3"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_role_id": "repairer",
          "text": "准备推闸。",
          "line_id": "ep2-s3-l4"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sfx",
          "speaker_role_id": null,
          "text": "电闸推上，喇叭突然传出极其刺耳的高频啸叫",
          "line_id": "ep2-s3-l5"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_role_id": "repairer",
          "text": "拔电源！快！",
          "line_id": "ep2-s3-l6"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sfx",
          "speaker_role_id": null,
          "text": "手忙脚乱碰倒工具，手背撞到黄铜铃铛发出一声单响，随后啸叫声戛然而止",
          "line_id": "ep2-s3-l7"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_role_id": "host",
          "text": "哎哟！……电源拔了。刚才那一声……不算啊。",
          "line_id": "ep2-s3-l8"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_role_id": "repairer",
          "text": "功放块击穿了。",
          "line_id": "ep2-s3-l9"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sfx",
          "speaker_role_id": null,
          "text": "电路图纸在操作台上铺开的摩擦声，万用表递出的碰撞声",
          "line_id": "ep2-s3-l10"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_role_id": "repairer",
          "text": "图纸我压着，表笔拿好，咱们从输出端重新查。",
          "line_id": "ep2-s3-l11"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker_role_id": "host",
          "text": "好，红黑表笔就位，随时准备测功放块。",
          "line_id": "ep2-s3-l12"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "episode_summary": "本集聚焦于主控板的深度修复。面对断电警报，周野急躁欲重启被林岚制止。在拆解更换电容的过程中，周野吐露急于恢复广播是为了陪伴老街坊，林岚理解其执念并认可他的成长，两人达成内心和解。然而推闸测试时设备突发啸叫，周野手忙脚乱中意外碰响单声铃铛，三声铃报平安的约定被迫搁置。断电后，两人迅速铺开图纸、递接万用表，默契转入功放块的排查验收准备。",
  "fact_delta": [
    {
      "change": "确认主控板滤波电容鼓包老化，完成电容更换与物理修复。"
    },
    {
      "change": "推闸测试时功放块击穿引发刺耳啸叫，设备再次断电，未通过最终验收。"
    },
    {
      "change": "断电后两人迅速铺开电路图纸并交接万用表，展开功放块排查的验收准备动作。"
    }
  ],
  "relationship_delta": [
    {
      "change": "周野坦露急于恢复广播的初衷与对旧事的内疚，林岚理解其执念并给予认可，两人彻底解开旧日心结，达成内心和解与双向治愈。"
    },
    {
      "change": "面对突发啸叫故障，两人未受挫且无抱怨，通过默契递接工具与图纸，展现出高度信任与专业的合作默契。"
    }
  ],
  "new_open_threads": [
    "三声铃报平安",
    "功放块击穿与深层电路排查"
  ],
  "closed_threads": [
    "主控板电容老化导致的自检未过故障"
  ]
}
